      "query": "",
      "retrieved_memories": [],
      "code": "",
      "execution_output": "User: Actually, for the San Francisco to New York trip, I think I’ll just call back later to finish that booking. \n\nBut I’m still really frustrated about that delayed flight. It wasn’t just a small delay—I was stuck waiting for hours with almost no updates, and it completely threw off my plans when I finally arrived. No one seemed to take any responsibility or offer any help. It’s been a really disappointing experience overall.",
